{"id":71077,"date":"2026-10-28T07:12:31","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:12:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71077"},"modified":"2026-10-28T08:14:24","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:14:24","slug":"trail-do-rio-paiva","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-rio-paiva\/","title":{"rendered":"VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partidas e chegadas no <strong>Parque de Autocaravanismo de Souselo<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 Igreja e \u00e0 Escola EB 2\/3 de Souselo), no concelho de <strong>Cinf\u00e3es<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Esta prova competitiva de corrida de montanha convida-te a descobrir os trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e paisagens naturais esculpidas pelo vale do <strong>rio Paiva<\/strong> e seus afluentes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes desafiar os teus limites no <strong>TRP35K (35 km com 1.800 m D+)<\/strong>, que percorre as freguesias de <strong>Souselo, Tarouquela, Travanca e Moimenta<\/strong>, optar pelo <strong>TRP23K (23 km com 1.100 m D+)<\/strong> ou pelo <strong>TRP15K (15 km com 700 m D+)<\/strong>, ou participar na <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> pelos trilhos de Souselo. Todo o tra\u00e7ado encontra-se balizado com fitas laranja e placas direcionais, dispondo de postos de abastecimento aos km 6, 12 e 22.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Duelo D\u2019Ocasi\u00e3o - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Cinf\u00e3es<\/strong> e assist\u00eancia dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Nespereira, o evento assegura cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, pr\u00e9mio finisher, banhos quentes no pavilh\u00e3o desportivo da Escola EB 2\/3 de Souselo e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\