tyle=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Nov a 31 Dez 2026 (c\/ almo\u00e7o))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 19,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Jan a 20 Fev 2027 (c\/ almo\u00e7o))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 21,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21 Fev a 28 Fev 2027 (c\/ almo\u00e7o))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:40<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Nov a 31 Dez 2026 (c\/ almo\u00e7o))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (1 Jan a 20 Fev 2027 (c\/ almo\u00e7o))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 19,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (21 Fev a 28 Fev 2027 (c\/ almo\u00e7o))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partidas e chegadas no Parque de Autocaravanismo de Souselo (Rua St. Andr\u00e9, 4690-637 Souselo), no concelho de Cinf\u00e3es, distrito de Viseu.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e dist\u00e2ncias de cada percurso?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O TRP35K (35 km, 1800 m D+) parte \u00e0s 08:30; o TRP23K (23 km, 1100 m D+) parte \u00e0s 09:00; o TRP15K (15 km, 700 m D+) parte \u00e0s 09:30; e a Caminhada de 10 km inicia-se \u00e0s 09:40.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos das fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De 1 de novembro a 31 de dezembro de 2026: 21 \u20ac (35K), 19 \u20ac (23K), 17 \u20ac (15K) e 15 \u20ac (Caminhada). De 1 de janeiro a 20 de fevereiro de 2027: 23 \u20ac (35K), 21 \u20ac (23K), 19 \u20ac (15K) e 17 \u20ac (Caminhada). De 21 a 28 de fevereiro de 2027: 25 \u20ac (35K), 23 \u20ac (23K), 21 \u20ac (15K) e 19 \u20ac (Caminhada), todos com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, material obrigat\u00f3rio e local do secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 5h30 (com barreira hor\u00e1ria \u00e0s 4h00 no \u00faltimo abastecimento), sendo obrigat\u00f3rio transportar apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e telem\u00f3vel operacional. O secretariado funciona no Parque de Autocaravanismo de Souselo no s\u00e1bado (16h00\u201320h00) e no domingo (07h00\u201309h10).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Duelo D\u2019Ocasi\u00e3o - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o, contando com o apoio institucional e log\u00edstico do Munic\u00edpio de Cinf\u00e3es.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque de Autocaravanismo de Souselo, Cinf\u00e3es\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Cinf\u00e3es\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O VIII Trail do Rio Paiva 2027 realiza-se a 7 de mar\u00e7o em Souselo, Cinf\u00e3es. Trail de 35 km, 23 km, 15 km e Caminhada 10 km. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-do-rio-paiva-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo (TRP35K)\", \"price\": \"21.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/viii-trail-do-rio-paiva\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail M\u00e9dio (TRP23K)\", \"price\": \"19.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org